Subject: Restore original shadow mesh writer outside explicit preview profile
Upstream-base: 2c5c51e483b652d178ef06a44b83b07a0f97d2a6

R02 fidelity correction: retain literal original Begin/End/write decisions and
class layout for the isolated game module and ordinary native source profile.
Scope inherited frame-generation, finite-value, count/resource restrictions,
material zero-initialization and extra fields to diagnostic mesh writers.
Keep the actual native four-byte colour copy and coherent-host cache boundary.
Console projection remains unchanged. Mixed game/diagnostic profile rejected.

